// The grapple run's course: ten gates in a loop, from just off our ship's
// stern, out through a cluster of rocks and back past its bow (the
// "Grapple run" scenario places it with its origin at the first gate, 17 m
// behind our stern). The rocks are the scenario's, kept clear of the gates.
// See docs/ships.md.
Design(
    name: "COURSE",
    hostile: false,
    model: None,
    shield: (center: (0.0, 0.0, 0.0), radii: (5.0, 5.0, 5.0)),
    turrets: [],
    modules: [(module: "course/gates")],
)
